<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - July 30.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - July 30.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST  180 CST    MDO    GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   98/100   100/102    UNQ    168/172</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	 102/104   105/107  175/180  183/185</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - The Singapore bunker market continued its firm tone on Wednesday to reflect recent berth congestion as well as crude gains, traders said. They said the upward momentum would likely continue in the short term though most traders did not expect major gains in the face of only moderate enquiries.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3571)</p>
